Subject: [PATCH 118/220] [ae-patch] Preview a pull request when the pointer
 rests on a chat link to it

A hover card on any GitHub pull request link in chat shows the state, repo
and number, title, author, size of the change and, while open, its checks,
from the merge card's /v1/ae/prs data and query cache. The fetch starts only
when the card opens.
